  <read_first>
    - Dockerfile (root; header comment, ARG pin at top, single apt-get layer - the house style)
    - compose.yaml (db service ports/volume/healthcheck style, header comment listing smoke-only variables)
    - apps/worker/test/node-version.test.ts (repo-file assertion style for the new static test)
    - .planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-RESEARCH.md sections "Pattern 1", "Pattern 2", "Compose service shape", Pitfalls 1, 2, 3, 11
    - .planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-CONTEXT.md D-29, D-30, D-32, D-37, D-38, D-72, D-73, D-79
