  </verify>
  <acceptance_criteria>
    - `grep -c '^ARG BRIDGE_COMMIT=04e46eb4fbc1c7ef4425a920bfc352050da0606b$' bridge/Dockerfile` prints 1
    - `grep -A2 '^# renovate: datasource=github-tags depName=ProtonMail/proton-bridge$' bridge/Dockerfile` shows the BRIDGE_VERSION and BRIDGE_COMMIT lines directly below
    - `! grep -nE 'COPY .*/proton-bridge( |$)' bridge/Dockerfile` (launcher never shipped)
