<objective>
Give app code the database operations ingest needs, without widening the scoped API beyond what the scope can filter:
- an ON CONFLICT upsert on unique targets
- set-valued equality match
- an expiry delete for the body cache
- the ingest use-cases in `packages/db/src/ingest.ts`, written in the style of `status.ts`

Purpose: identity merging (D-14), location tracking (D-15), the body-cache lifecycle (D-06, D-07) and the generation resync (D-23) become database operations that are idempotent by construction. The sync engine (02-10) and the worker (02-13) only orchestrate them.

Output: scope.ts extensions, ingest.ts, exports and real-database tests.
</objective>

