  <name>Task 1: Tracer - storeMessages writes message, location and body through withMailbox and is idempotent on rerun</name>
  <files>packages/db/src/scope.ts, packages/db/src/ingest.ts, packages/db/src/index.ts, packages/db/test/ingest.test.ts</files>
  <read_first>
    - packages/db/src/scope.ts (scopedTable, matchConditions, definedEntries, FORBIDDEN_SET_KEYS, mailboxStatusApi.upsert's onConflictDoUpdate)
