- the valve check (count candidate-new before any fetchHeaders; over newMailCap returns needs_attention and writes nothing)
- the removal diff over live locations of the current uidValidity and generation, using listUids on their UID range, then markVanished
- the deleteExpiredBodies sweep at the end of a synced cycle

The backfill slice stays outside the valve (D-75).

Implement countBackfill and runBackfill per the interfaces block. Both refuse as described. They use searchSince(now - days), then fetchDates, then backfillWindow over the whole folder. runBackfill processes everything in chunks with `advance: null` and `promoteEligible: true`, checks abort between chunks, and has no cap and no pause. The CLI asks the owner before calling it. Add the behavior cases.
  </action>
