2. `docker compose run --rm setup sift mailbox list` shows your mailbox as `ok`; while the 30-day backfill runs, it also shows its progress (for example `backfilling 400 of 1,250`).
3. `docker compose exec -T db psql -U postgres -d sift -Atc "select count(*) from message"` prints a number N.
