- End-of-phase human check: the real-mailbox run in Task 3 (success criteria 3 and 4)
</verification>

<success_criteria>
- ROADMAP Phase 2 success criteria 3, 4 and 5 hold against a real IMAP server, automated; the human check confirms 3 and 4 against Bridge
- D-33/D-34/D-73 states are specific and per mailbox; D-26 holds surges; D-75's first backfill shows progress; D-03 serialises ingesters
</success_criteria>

