- Symbols: `createDbStore`, `createMailboxCallbacks(db, secrets, ingest)`, `MailboxIngestOptions`, `MailboxSyncError`, `ownerMessageFor`, `STARTUP_GRACE_MS` (60000), `BRIDGE_INIT_COMMAND`, `seedImapMailbox`
- Log lines: `mailbox synced`, `ingest busy (another process holds mailbox)`, `waiting for sift mailbox resume <slug>`, `ingest stopped between chunks`
