- D-80 holds and is tested on the wire: the unverified capture connection carries nothing but STARTTLS and the handshake; credentials go only over a verified connection; nothing is written to disk
- Error classes give 02-13 what it needs for D-33/D-34 status messages and the pin-mismatch state
</success_criteria>

