.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:30:    - "With a wrong or empty SIFT_BRIDGE_KEYCHAIN_PASSPHRASE, or on a volume that was never initialised, the bridge container exits 78 with a fixed message before Bridge starts, so Bridge never runs with an unencrypted vault (D-38, Pitfall 2)"
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:31:    - "The image ships only the `bridge` binary; the auto-updating launcher is never copied into the runtime stage (D-30)"
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:32:    - "compose.yaml: bridge publishes 1143 on host loopback only; the sift-bridge volume is external with a name variable and is mounted only by the bridge and bridge-init services; SIFT_BRIDGE_KEYCHAIN_PASSPHRASE reaches only those two services; the worker has no depends_on bridge and no Bridge volume or certificate mount (D-29, D-32, D-37, D-38, D-73, D-79)"
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:33:    - "The long-running bridge service mounts only sift-bridge: it never sees .env.mailboxes or the config directory (D-39, D-79)"
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:34:    - "A separate one-shot `bridge-init` service (same image and build as bridge, `profiles: [\"tools\"]`, `command: [\"init\"]`, no ports, restart \"no\") mounts sift-bridge at /data, the mailbox env file read-write at /run/sift/.env.mailboxes, the config directory read-only at /run/sift/config, and (D-81) the owner's pre-created backup file through a long-syntax bind (`type: bind`, `source: ./.env.mailboxes.bak`, `target: /run/sift/.env.mailboxes.bak`), so a missing backup file makes Compose stop instead of creating a directory. `docker compose up` never starts it; the owner runs `docker compose run --rm bridge-init`, and the other one-shot modes run as `docker compose run --rm bridge-init <mode>` (D-39, D-72, D-79, D-81)"
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:35:    - "compose-smoke never builds or starts the bridge service, runs on its own external bridge volume, and fills SIFT_BRIDGE_KEYCHAIN_PASSPHRASE in its generated .env"
