.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:121:    volumes: sift-bridge:/data, ${SIFT_MAILBOXES_ENV_FILE:-./.env.mailboxes}:/run/sift/.env.mailboxes, ${SIFT_CONFIG_HOST_DIR:-./config}:/run/sift/config:ro,
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-01-PLAN.md:127:    Owner command: docker compose run --rm bridge-init. Other one-shot modes (02-08): docker compose run --rm bridge-init configure | cli | repair | keychain-init.
