.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-18-PLAN.md:79:Purpose: these rules are the security boundary of every later IMAP call (02-09, 02-11, 02-13, 02-16), and the capture is what `sift bridge trust` shows the owner (02-15). The capture handshake is the one place verification is off; D-80 records that decision, and this plan proves on the wire that the exception carries nothing.
