.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-08-PLAN.md:90:From 02-01 (bridge/entrypoint.sh): helpers as_bridge, require_passphrase, keychain_init, keychain_unlock, spki_fingerprint, print_fingerprint; modes serve, keychain-init; exit 78 on keychain or vault refusal; runs as root, Bridge processes as uid 1000. The bridge service mounts only /data (vault). The one-shot bridge-init service (default command init) mounts /data, /run/sift/.env.mailboxes (read-write file), /run/sift/config (read-only dir with config.yaml) and /run/sift/.env.mailboxes.bak (the owner's pre-created backup file, long-syntax bind) (D-79, D-81).
.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-08-PLAN.md:91:Every one-shot mode below runs through bridge-init: `docker compose run --rm bridge-init` (init), or `docker compose run --rm bridge-init configure|cli|repair`.
