.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-SUMMARY.md:156:- All eight M1 tables exist after `migrate()`: `mailbox` (unscoped registry with `mailbox_slug_format` and `mailbox_imap_port_range` checks) and the seven scoped tables `mailbox_status`, `message`, `label`, `decision`, `folder_sync`, `label_event`, `rule_set`. Primary keys default to PG18 `uuidv7()`, and `mailbox_status` is keyed by `mailbox_id`.
.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-SUMMARY.md:158:- Grants follow D-40: SELECT on `mailbox`, the four DML verbs on `message`, `mailbox_status`, `label`, `folder_sync` and `rule_set`, and SELECT+INSERT on the append-only `decision` and `label_event`. No TRUNCATE, no `GRANT ALL`, no default privileges.
.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-SUMMARY.md:174:- `packages/db/src/schema/index.ts` - Barrel plus `SCOPED_TABLE_NAMES`, `APPEND_ONLY_TABLE_NAMES`, `MAILBOX_COLUMNS`, `MailboxRow`
.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-SUMMARY.md:201:- **Issue:** The `mailbox_status` doc comment said "not a pgEnum", so `grep -c pgEnum packages/db/src/schema/scoped.ts` printed 1 instead of 0.
.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-SUMMARY.md:228:- 01-05 (catalog and isolation tests) can use `freshDatabase()`, `seedMailboxes()`, `seedScopedRows()`, `SCOPED_TABLE_NAMES`, `APPEND_ONLY_TABLE_NAMES` and `MAILBOX_COLUMNS`.
.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-SUMMARY.md:230:- The scoped API plan (withMailbox) can import the table objects from `packages/db/src/schema/index.ts`.
