.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-03-PLAN.md:272:   - For each name in SCOPED_TABLE_NAMES, seed via seedScopedRows. Then, as sift_app under that mailbox, `select count(*)` is at least 1 for every table, and with no setting it is 0.
