.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-RESEARCH.md:466:- **`set_config(..., false)` or `SET app.mailbox_id`** in `withMailbox`: the value leaks to the next pool user. Always use `is_local = true`.
.planning/phases/01-foundation-and-isolation/01-RESEARCH.md:471:- **pgEnum for `mailbox_status.state`:** `ALTER TYPE … ADD VALUE` interacts badly with the single-transaction migrator. Use `text` + `check()`.
