.planning/phases/02-bridge-spike-and-imap-ingest/02-17-PLAN.md:157:   - Bridge's public key is pinned through `imap.tls.pin_sha256`. A regenerated certificate stops the mailbox until the owner compares the fingerprint with `sift bridge trust <slug>` and updates config. Public-CA servers can omit the pin and use normal certificate checks.
